// Regression test: DenseMap reference invalidation in
// annotateDeallocations (lib/Iara/Passes/VirtualFIFO/SDF/GenerateMemoryManagementNodes.cpp).
//
// kernel_split fans out %sN to F read-only consumers (broadcast), inflating
// StaticAnalysisData::edge_static_info. Each consumer output is an inout chain
// end -> one dealloc. With enough chains the dealloc-edge insert at line ~164
// grows the DenseMap mid-loop, dangling the last_edge_info reference taken at
// ~line 131 -> use-after-free segfault. Needs >=119 chains (F=2) to cross the
// first grow boundary inside a dealloc loop; 128 used for margin.

